  "notes": "<p>Below is an extract form the CHANGELOG file showing all the updates for this release.</p>\n<p>The major addition to this version is the development of the Floating Lidar File format. This is version 1.0.0-2025.06 and will follow its own independent versioning. Other changes in this release are to expand the data model to include more floating lidar and metocean measurements, sensors and units.</p>\n<p>The Digital Calibration Certificate had a few units added and is now on version 1.2.0-2025.06.</p>\n[1.4.0-2025.06]\n<ol>\n<li>Introduce the first release of the <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/tree/master/floating_lidar_file_format\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Floating Lidar File Format</a> developed based on discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>.</li>\n<li>To <code>lidar_config</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>logger_stated_device_datum_plane_height_m</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/254\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#254</a>)</li>\n<li><code>logger_stated_device_orientation_deg</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/254\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#254</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>To <code>calibration</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>slope_unit</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a>)</li>\n<li><code>offset_unit</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a>)</li>\n<li><code>sensitivity_unit</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>As a result of Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a> above, <code>measurement_units</code> are now a definition.</li>\n<li>To <code>measurement_units</code> enum add:<ol>\n<li><code>mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>(m/s)/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>mbar/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>mbar/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>hPa/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>hPa/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>deg_C/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>deg_C/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>%/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>%/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>m^2/Hz</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>m^2_s</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13382090\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>Pa</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/279\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#279</a>)</li>\n<li><code>ppm</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>ug/L</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>ntu</code>, <code>fnu</code> and <code>ftu</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>To <code>sensor_type</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>calc</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-11257819\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>fuel_gauge</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-11257819\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>microwave_temperature_profiler</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>nephelometer</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_buoy</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12716402\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>transmissometer</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>fluorometer</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>gps_motion_unit</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>To <code>measurement_type</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>fuel_level</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-11257819\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>pitch</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>roll</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>heading</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>turbidity</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>visibility_in_air</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_energy_spectrum</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_energy_spectrum_maximum</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_period_first_frequency</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_period_second_frequency</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_period_zero_crossing</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>mass_concentration</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>Bug fixes:<ol>\n<li>Add <code>null</code> to <code>license</code> type as it is optional (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/269\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#269</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\nFloating Lidar File Format [1.0.0-2025.06]\n<ol>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ol>\nDigital Calibration Certificate [1.2.0-2025.06]\n<ol>\n<li>To <code>unit</code> enum add:<ol>\n<li><code>mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>(m/s)/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>",
